(GOVERNMENT OF INDIA - MINISTRY OF MICRO, SMALL AND MEDIUM ENTERPRISES) Tj
T*
(OPERATIONAL GUIDELINES: ASPIRE \(SCHEME FOR PROMOTION OF INNOVATION, RURAL INDUSTRY & ENTREPRENEURSHIP\) \(ASPIRE\) / MOMSME / SIDBI / COIR BOARD / KVIC) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Overview & Objective:) Tj
T*
(Sets up Livelihood Business Incubators \(LBIs\) and Technology Business) Tj
T*
(Incubators \(TBIs\) to promote rural agro-business enterprise creation and) Tj
T*
(employment.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Eligibility Criteria:) Tj
T*
(1. Agro-rural entrepreneurs, educational institutions, or technical bodies) Tj
T*
(   setting up LBI/TBI incubators in rural/semi-urban areas.) Tj
T*
(2. Focus on skilling youth and translating rural produce into value-added) Tj
T*
(   enterprise goods.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Financial Assistance and Subsidy:) Tj
T*
(1. One-time 100% grant of up to Rs. 1 Crore for government agencies and up to) Tj
T*
(   Rs. 50 Lakh for private bodies for plant and machinery procurement for LBI) Tj
T*
(   incubators.) Tj
T*
(2. Concession or margin money subsidy rate of 100.0 % subsidy.) Tj
T*
(3. Maximum financial assistance cap is Rs 1.00 Crore per unit.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Mandatory Documents Checklist:) Tj
T*
(1. Detailed Project Report \(DPR\)) Tj
T*
(2. Institutional registration and land proof) Tj
T*
(3. Curriculum and machinery layout for livelihood training) Tj
T*
(4. Udyam registration for participating rural units) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Application Procedure:) Tj
T*
(1. Mode: Online through ASPIRE portal / MSME Champions) Tj
T*
(2. Official Portal: https://aspire.msme.gov.in/) Tj
T*
